      "status_terms_zh": [
        "减速"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Shen recalls his spirit blade to attack with it, dealing damage based on the target's max health. The attacks are greatly empowered if it collides with an enemy champion, and all collided enemies are slowed while running away from Shen.",
      "summary_zh": "慎召回他的魂刃并用它进行攻击，造成基于目标最大生命值的额外伤害。如果魂刃在召回途中与一个敌方英雄产生了碰撞，那么慎的魂刃攻击会获得极大强化，并且所有被碰撞的敌人在逃离慎的时候都会被减速。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309225:4008038"
      ]
    },
